[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) merged 412 reports and was marked known: one cause, the shared
parser, fix queued. Its own [CauseTable](/kb/incidents/4471) — unchanged below, the desk's own
counts, as exported — already shows a second cause, `hint`, living in the same ticket with no
